      "name": "Legionary Brigadier Maekarn",
      "topics": [
        {
          "title": "Journey to Fort Strathelar",
          "text": "From this fort the Stalwart directed their Gearknights against the Olthoi. The Knorr Expeditionary Forces now defend the Shield Wall. Otonku sends his reports here from the Aerie.",
