      "topics": [
        {
          "title": "Shreth-Hunter's Guide to Omishan",
          "text": "Lupe in Hakata is compiling a guide to Omishan. The Warders of Zu, Hakata, Ankoro, Rakani, Ikeras, Shinoko and Mayoi are the seven trackers named in her manuscript.",
